# Pakai ekstensi "REST Client" di VS Code, lalu klik "Send Request" di atas tiap blok.
# Lebih mudah daripada curl di Command Prompt karena tidak perlu escape tanda kutip.

@host = http://localhost:8081

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Register
POST {{host}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "andi@example.com", "password": "rahasia123" }

### Register dengan role (harus DITOLAK 400, field role tidak dikenal)
POST {{host}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hacker@example.com", "password": "rahasia123", "role": "admin" }

### Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "andi@example.com", "password": "rahasia123" }

### Verify (memakai access token dari login di atas)
GET {{host}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Refresh (token lama langsung hangus setelah dipakai)
# @name refreshed
POST {{host}}/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refresh_token": "{{login.response.body.refresh_token}}" }

### Logout (cabut refresh token hasil refresh di atas)
POST {{host}}/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refresh_token": "{{refreshed.response.body.refresh_token}}" }
